{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>港珠澳大橋往香港方向，傍晚開始出現擠塞。</p><p></p><p>下午近5時，在澳門高處，望向連接港珠澳大橋的高速公路，已出現車龍。大橋珠海口岸微信公眾號，亦顯示下午4時半起，客車出境港澳的通道，處於「極度高峰」，車龍超過500米，候檢時間超過40分鐘。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.BRIDGE.JAM-1830_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Cc3A01IqoK1792406008.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>運輸署亦表示，大橋往香港方向車輛通關廣場非常繁忙，呼籲計劃駕車經大橋返港的市民，預留充足交通時間。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T10:59:05.302401+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":165,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T10:23:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T14:39:30.475982+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T10:56:55.129363+00:00","content_hash":"f89079e5efa7100e9e668391c2e156691f5ae975558f10c5888a31829b77b719","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}